    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049590/extras/e006350a1c182e9f71e57b43d6923570.avif?t=1753349162\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Search, Craft, Hunt! An Eternal Survival Experiment</h2>On the deserted Lumia Island, the seedy organization known as AGLAIA is conducting secret experiments on human subjects in a bid to perfect a new race of extraordinary humans.<br>Work with your teammates and craft weapons and armor that are required for your survival!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Experiment Has Begun.</strong></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049590/extras/8c209eaaa8deb370056925391e411495.poster.avif?t=1753349162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049590/extras/8c209eaaa8deb370056925391e411495.webm?t=1753349162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049590/extras/8c209eaaa8deb370056925391e411495.mp4?t=1753349162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049590/extras/7be4f2242a25e85fe8220af08cb33692.poster.avif?t=1753349162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049590/extras/7be4f2242a25e85fe8220af08cb33692.webm?t=1753349162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049590/extras/7be4f2242a25e85fe8220af08cb33692.mp4?t=1753349162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st